<section class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <p>We connect neighbors with neighbors to share skills, support, and friendship so everyone can thrive in every decade.</p>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Build connection</h3>
        <p>Small-group activities, monthly socials, interest circles, and friendly check-ins keep members engaged and seen.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Coordinate support</h3>
        <p>Volunteers help with rides, errands, tech help, light tasks, and companionship, matched to each member.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Learn together</h3>
        <p>Educational events, wellness sessions, and resource sharing so members feel informed and confident.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

